    "settings": [{"type":"paragraph","content":"Section design by GemPages. [Click here to start design](https://admin.shopify.com/store/429531/apps/gempages-cro/app/shopify/edit?pageType=GP_ARTICLE&editorId=576267057851532227&sectionId=576270161737155146)"},{"type":"select","label":"Section Preload","id":"section_preload","options":[{"label":"On","value":"true"},{"label":"Off","value":"false"},{"label":"Off Lazy Script","value":"off_lazy_script"}],"default":"false"},{"type":"text","label":"Checksum","id":"checksum"},{"type":"html","id":"gg41fLeudQj_text","label":"gg41fLeudQj_text","default":"<span style=\"font-size:29px;\">How to Incorporate Bakuchiol into Your Routine</span>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg99Hv1kXGB_text","label":"gg99Hv1kXGB_text","default":"<p>Adding bakuchiol to your skincare routine is easy when you follow a few steps. It's gentle and works well for many skin types.&nbsp; Some people do a patch test first, mainly if their skin is sensitive.<br>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Application Tips</strong></p><p>Begin with a clean, dry face. Use a small amount of bakuchiol serum and let it soak in. After, apply a light moisturizer and don't forget a broad-spectrum sunscreen for outside time.&nbsp;<br>Don't mix bakuchiol with strong acids like glycolic acid at the same time. You can also blend it with facial oils or use it under exfoliating serums for extra care.<br>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Frequency of Use</strong></p><p>PRANA recommends using bakuchiol once or twice a day. Start with an evening application and increase&nbsp;<br>to morning and night if your skin likes it. It's safe for daily use but reduce if dryness occurs.</p><p>Using bakuchiol with sunscreen during the day helps protect your skin.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggq31u0vWX3_label","label":"ggq31u0vWX3_label","default":"Buy It Now"}],
